    <h2 class="section-title">What affects the price?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Size and layout:</strong> the number of cabinets, and how many are drawers rather than doors.</li>
      <li><strong>Timber and finish:</strong> hand-painted, oiled oak, walnut or a mix.</li>
      <li><strong>The room:</strong> old houses with uneven walls and floors take more scribing and fitting time.</li>
      <li><strong>Extras:</strong> islands, larders, plate racks, dressers and appliance housings.</li>
      <li><strong>Other trades:</strong> whether you'd like me to manage plumbing, electrics, flooring or building work.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The best way to get a real figure is a short conversation and a site visit. Send a few photos and rough measurements and I'll tell you honestly whether it fits your budget.</p>
